    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερδείδω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fear for</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ὑπερδέδοικά σου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					82
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράκοντας . . τέκνων ὑπερδέδοικε</span>
			<i>fears</i> them <i>for</i> or <i>because of . . ,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				293
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fear exceedingly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινας</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				10.138c
			</span></i>: abs., <i>to be in exceeding fear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.94
			</span></i>.</div>
